{
  "format": "tmt-colab-work",
  "version": 2,
  "description": "The work value of an ordinary page (`meta.work`, version 2: its ordered direct sub-pages and its two-line summary), detached actions and the read-only projection of the task-era version 1 value, shared by the native and browser validators. Attribution comes from the write owner and appears only in the stored summary; the link admission (one parent, no loop, an available page) is the write owner's rule and appears in no vector. `children` is the sub-page list a reader projects; a version 1 document is migration input only, and every write produces version 2.",
